	\L_00d47:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　Under the Continent'
	\L_00e34:
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	'Hundreds and hundreds of'
	R
	'meters under the center of the'
	R
	'continent, there was a large,'
	R
	'empty space.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'It existed for God.'
	R
	'Rudrasaum, the creator god,'
	R
	'lived there.'
	\L_00e34:
	\L_00e27:
	EC 0:
	G 806:
	G 516:
	\L_00def:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「...I’m bored...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum muttered in a space within the space.'
	R
	'It echoed.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Bored... Bored...'
	R
	'          It’s just... not interesting...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum’s giant body of about two kilometers　in'
	R
	'length slowly turned.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「And I went to the trouble of making the'
	R
	'          lifeforms on the continent savage so it'
	R
	'          would be more dramatic, too...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「How was the world united...?'
	R
	'          Now there’s not gonna be any more war...'
	R
	'          That’s boring...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum was not sulking, but enraged.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「But I really liked watching these tiny'
	R
	'          beings, running around doing their tiny'
	'          things...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Now they’re boring... I don’t need them.'
	R
	'          This world’s done.'
	R
	'          Gotta destroy it and toss it out.」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「That’s it, that’s my decision.'
	R
	'          Smash it and toss it...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum’s tail wagged at its own idea.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum was the god that made Rance and the'
	R
	'others’ world... They existed because of Rudrasaum.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum derived pleasure from the tiny beings it'
	R
	'created from pieces of its own life killing each'
	R
	'other for all their various reasons.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'But Rance appeared and rapidly united the world.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'In other words, the world was at peace.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Murder, conflict, chaos...'
	R
	'The things Rudrasaum enjoyed were taken away.'
	R
	'And so it was angry.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Yep, chaos...'
	R
	'          Chaos is the greatest pleasure...'
	R
	'          Hee... Heehee...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Angel knight... Are you here?」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Angel Knight「Yes, Rudrasaum...'
	R
	'             I am...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'An angel knight appeared before Rudrasaum’s enormous'
	R
	'body.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「This world’s boring...'
	R
	'          I’m gonna smash it, so before that...'
	R
	'          Stir things up a bit.」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「I toiled to make it, so I don’t really'
	R
	'          want to smash it all at once...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「So to end it off, let’s have an exciting'
	R
	'          war. Slaughter everyone you want.」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「But... You can’t do it all at once.'
	R
	'          Sloooooowly.」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Angel Knight「As you wish.」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'The angel knight understood Rudrasaum’s command and'
	R
	'disappeared.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「...Ppth...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Hee... Heehee...'
	R
	'          ...Huhuhu...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「It’s a war...'
	R
	'          This time the enemy’ll be a bit tough...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Hee... Heehee... Will they be okay?'
	R
	'          Heehee... Huhuhu...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'While Rudrasaum giggled, countless specks flew over'
	R
	'his head.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'They were all powerful angel knights and monsters...'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'They were leaving to attack the world Rance ruled...'
	R
	'Envoys of chaos...'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Hee... Heeheehee...」'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum squirmed with delight.'
	\L_00e34:
