	'I’ve got so much free time.'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'.........'
	\L_00e34:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ve kind of gotten bored of'
	R
	'being a king...'
	\L_00e34:
	\L_00e27:
	\L_00d7f:
	ZH 1:
	'Ahn, don’t say that.'
	R
	'Darling.'
